# ROVEXO Performance Master Lock

**STATUS: GLOBAL | MANDATORY | ENTIRE PLATFORM**

## Never reduce

No implementation may reduce: Performance · Speed · Responsiveness · SEO · Accessibility · Mobile experience · Security · Stability · Animations · Loading times.

## Forbidden

- Unnecessary re-renders
- Duplicate components
- Duplicate API calls
- Unused imports / unused code
- Large components / large images
- Slow animations
- Blocking requests
- Memory leaks

## Every new feature must be

**Lighter · Faster · Safer · Simpler**

## Choice rule

If two solutions exist, always use: **the fastest + the safest + the simplest**.

## Responsive design must never break

iPhone · Android · Tablets · Desktop

## All pages must respect

- Mobile First
- 100% Width
- Zero UI Freeze
- Instant UI Feedback
- Background Loading
- Skeleton Loading
- Optimistic UI

## Zero Performance Damage Policy

- If performance can be reduced → **STOP**
- If memory usage can increase → **STOP**
- If responsive design can break → **STOP**
- If a safer solution exists → **USE IT**

## Final rule

Never sacrifice Performance · Security · Responsive Design · UX · Stability for new features, visual effects, animations, or quick implementations.

**Owner approval required.**
